msgstr "Bật chuyển đổi địa chỉ từ cấu trúc cũ sang cấu trúc mới"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:237
msgid ""
"Converts existing orders from the old address structure to the new structure "
"using the bundled conversion table. Most wards convert automatically; a "
"small number that were split between multiple new wards during the merger "
"are flagged for manual review instead of being guessed."
msgstr ""

